        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Storeroom Function Lever for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a wide Escutcheon Plate Storeroom Function Lever (Outside entrance by lever when latch bolt is retracted by Key)  is suitable for all Wide and Medium  Stile Doors \r\n(aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.  Heavy duty commercial set covers standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-rim-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300r\"><b>6300 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-surface-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300v\"><b>6300 Series Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/wide-escutcheon-plate-passage-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-6-w-14-phl\"><b>Passage Function Lever for 6300 Series Panic Device</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/wide-escutcheon-plate-classroom-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-6-w-08-phl\"><b>Classroom Function Lever for 6300 Series Panic Device</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 6-W-09-PHL Storeroom Function Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li> Storeroom Function (ANSI F09) - Outside entrance by lever when latch bolt is retracted by Key.  (Lever only opens door when the key is turned). Key removable only when locked.</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Height: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/6-w-temp.pdf?v=1718159616\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 6-W Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/6W6N6T-Installation.pdf?v=1718159616\" target=\"new\"><b>Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
